content-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673658581_2305691467017762_2355319993536085916_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iZ1xQ1BIahEQ7kNvwGK9pXg&_nc_oc=AdrTNcDgJ1EVfDpjatOKt9cQiMJtOJWmgHAYvpGKIs9j22tknBNqAL7CnssNaS-QZLw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRm_QdYZ68IIC9EmNZ_b8CLjJckyApFnovWPvQi7J04oQ&oe=6AFC8678"}, "display_name": "Nut Sort VR: Bolt's Workshop", "keywords": ["nuts", "puzzle", "relaxing", "sorting", "robot"], "long_description": "Make room for a little calm in Bolt's workshop.\n\nTap a holder, then move its top nuts onto an empty holder or a matching color. Sort every color to complete the puzzle. Undo and Retry are free.\n\nYOUR PUZZLE JOURNEY\nPlay 60 main puzzles and six bonus challenges across six workshop settings. Earn coins, improve your scores and unlock cosmetic nut finishes. Every starting puzzle has a verified solution without buying an extra holder.\n\nMEET BOLT\nEnjoy your robot companion's hints, dances and reactions. Carry him around the workshop or try fetch with his toy ball.\n\nTAKE A PLAYFUL BREAK\nFind three hidden components, repair a music box and spend earned building parts on a miniature rover for your display. Pick up workshop props and try arranging them together.\n\nMAKE YOURSELF COMFORTABLE\nUse Touch controllers to aim or tap. Recenter at the workbench, teleport to marked spots, adjust your view height, use snap turning, move menus and drag to scroll. Choose your music, effects, voice and vibration settings.\n\nONE PURCHASE\nNo ads, subscriptions or in-app purchases. Coins and parts are earned by playing. Bolt's spoken reactions are included locally. Controller buttons provide all essential actions.", "short_description": "Sort colorful nuts in six cozy VR workshops. Solve puzzles, earn parts, repair a music box, build a miniature rover and play fetch with Bolt, your little robot companion."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url"